This License governs the use, reproduction, modification, distribution, and
commercialization of the software known as "GHOST-STACK CORE," including all
associated source code, object code, compiled binaries, eBPF programs,
documentation, configuration files, deployment scripts, and any derivative
works thereof (collectively, the "Software").

The Software embodies novel technical innovations — including but not limited
to kernel-level deception firewall architecture, passive eBPF observation
pipelines, and cryptographically enforced RBAC namespace isolation — which are
the subject of one or more pending patent applications filed by Mehmet Zumrut
in the United States Patent and Trademark Office (USPTO) and corresponding
international jurisdictions.

By accessing, downloading, cloning, forking, compiling, executing, or
otherwise using the Software in any form, you ("Licensee") agree to be bound
by all terms and conditions of this License. If you do not agree, you must
immediately cease all use and destroy all copies of the Software in your
possession.

